    "detailed_description": "Biscuitts 5 is a First Person Shooter game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProcedural Level Generation<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach level is orocedural with random elements so you will be faced with unique levels each time you play. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe fast-paced action is spiced up with a beautiful art found throughout the procedural level generation each time you play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\nThe player enter into a procedural generated level and need to clear the entire level from enemies to go to the next level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n- Every game is different - procedural levels<br />\r\n - Amazing Art",
